This is the upstream UPX-packed static i686 binary, including its terminal data.

mount.dynfilefs: DynFileFS 6.03, https://github.com/Tomas-M/dynfilefs (GNU GPL).
Local development static/dynfilefs based on published commit
534dce40291a65b9dda11a82ba0b30ec9e503bf6, release dynfilefs-v6.03,
with current-parent equality reporting and optional suppression of startup/end points.
Includes checksummed metadata redo, ordered cleanup and conversion publication,
with the pivot-root, snapshot and stable-ID fixes retained.
Use the project's static/build.sh: musl i686, -Os, stripped and UPX-packed.
Compiled source manifest SHA256: cd22154c775bbcf65c9ecc920139a659d501a0bc1d3c9a007821c2305cc4c97d
Manifest: sorted tracked .c/.h/.in/.ac files, Makefile.am and static/build.sh;
concatenate each UTF-8 path, NUL, exact file bytes and NUL before hashing.
Binary SHA256: 260e732ee2caf9a3a9b32499e728aea0a6b31472e1804b3ed03657622d62e142
The same functionality is included in DynFileFS 6.04 at commit
8cdac32b82731d8980d4a86aee6cf4e3d407b1f6. This is the tested 6.03 development build.
